'''''Sopa de fideo''''' ([[Spanish language|Spanish]] for "noodle soup"), also referred to as '''''sopita de fideo''''',<ref name="Cortés 1992"/> is a [[stock (food)|stock]]-based [[noodle soup]] that is a part of the cuisines of [[Spain]], [[Mexico]], and [[Cavite]], a province in the [[Philippines]].
